WEBVTT

00:07:27.726 --> 00:07:30.967
that is very normal right now;
the Edwards family.

00:07:31.582 --> 00:07:33.558
(Video) Jamie Oliver: Let's have a talk.

00:07:34.412 --> 00:07:38.445
This stuff goes through you
and your family's body every week.

00:07:38.469 --> 00:07:40.378
And I need you to know

00:07:40.402 --> 00:07:43.972
that this is going to kill
your children early.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.940
How are you feeling?

00:07:46.639 --> 00:07:49.916
Stacy: Just feeling really sad
and depressed right now.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.743
But, you know, I want
my kids to succeed in life

00:07:53.767 --> 00:07:55.916
and this isn't going to get them there.

00:07:56.749 --> 00:07:58.245
But I'm killing them.

00:07:59.655 --> 00:08:02.631
JO: Yes you are. You are.